  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature hits you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to force it to make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it has the Stunned condition until the end of your next turn, and its Speed is reduced to 0 while it is Stunned. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
